WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.849
The purpose of my program is to show a breakdancer doing

2
00:00:02.849 --> 00:00:05.494
a quick routine. He slides over to the right, does a

3
00:00:05.494 --> 00:00:08.139
full flip, slides back to the middle, and then moves

4
00:00:08.139 --> 00:00:08.800
away from us.

5
00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:12.570
When the green flag is clicked, the reset block puts him

6
00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:14.210
in the middle of the stage.

7
00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.170
Then he says let's dance.

8
00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:20.011
My code works by using repeats in this part to slide him

9
00:00:20.011 --> 00:00:20.780
to the right.

10
00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:24.788
It changes x by twenty and waits half a second, four

11
00:00:24.788 --> 00:00:25.210
times.

12
00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:27.890
Next he switches to his breakdancing costume.

13
00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:31.830
And it also uses repeats in this part to do the flip.

14
00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:35.961
He turns thirty six degrees at a time, and he does that

15
00:00:35.961 --> 00:00:36.650
ten times.

16
00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:41.090
Ten turns of thirty six degrees adds up to a full spin.

17
00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:42.870
Then he says nailed it.

18
00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:46.793
This repeat slides him back. It's the same as the first

19
00:00:46.793 --> 00:00:48.610
one, just with negative twenty.

20
00:00:48.970 --> 00:00:52.375
And the last repeat shrinks him by ten, five times, so

21
00:00:52.375 --> 00:00:54.330
it looks like he's moving away.

22
00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:56.670
Then he switches back to standing up,

23
00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:57.880
waits a second,

24
00:00:58.230 --> 00:00:59.190
and says goodbye.

25
00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:04.386
If I were to change this repeat like this, for example

26
00:01:04.386 --> 00:01:07.124
changing the ten to a five, the program would run

27
00:01:07.124 --> 00:01:10.196
differently. He would only turn halfway around, so he'd

28
00:01:10.196 --> 00:01:12.989
never finish the flip. So the number in the repeat

29
00:01:12.989 --> 00:01:16.061
really matters. It's the difference between nailing the

30
00:01:16.061 --> 00:01:17.290
flip and falling flat.

